        "$-12$"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "why": "For $x^{2} + bx + c = 0$, the solutions add to $-b$ and multiply to $c$. Here they're 2 and 6."
    },
    {
      "type": "spot",
      "prompt": "Solving $x^{2} = 9x$. Tap the line with the mistake.",
      "lines": [
